{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p007a","title":"孙权斫案禁言迎曹","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p007a-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"孙权斫案禁言迎曹","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p007a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"禁迎","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p007a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":208,"label":"赤壁议战时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhouyu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhouyu-q-o009","basis":"赤壁议战时"},"evidence":["zhouyu-e-p007a-q","zhouyu-q-o009","zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-p007a-q","source_order":[54,62,"P007a"],"order":9595}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p007a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-693763015f3a5c900fb2","layer":"pei","quote":"权拔刀斫前奏案曰：‘诸将吏敢复有言当迎操者，与此案同！","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-19fd8eb85b7b2ca85f96","start":11,"end":38},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。曹公得其水军船，步兵数十万。将士闻之皆恐。（惧）〔权〕延见群下〖8〗，问以计策。议者咸曰：“曹公，豺虎也！然托名汉相，挟天子以征四方，动以朝廷为辞；今日拒之，事更不顺。且将军大势：可以拒操者，长江也。今操得荆州，奄有其地〖9〗；刘表治水军，蒙冲、斗舰〖10〗，乃以千数，操悉浮以沿江；兼有步兵，水陆俱下。此为长江之险，已与我共之矣。而势力众寡，又不可论。愚谓大计不如迎之。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
